MID_MV30_00: <SH>
MID_MV30_00_m001: ¡Yo te maldigo por osar enfrentarte a mí!
MID_MV30_00_m002: ¡Insolente!
MID_MV30_00_m003: (growling sounds)
MID_MV30_00_m004: (small grunt of determination)
MID_MV30_00_m005: (charging growl)
MID_MV30_00_m006: (attack exert with their spear)
MID_MV30_00_m007: (big pained exert)
MID_MV30_00_m008: (short pained exert)
MID_MV30_00_m009: (landing exert)
MID_MV30_00_m010: (surprised breath exert)
MID_MV30_00_m011: ¡No, espera! ¡La fuente de mi poder! ¡Nooo!
MID_MV30_00_m012: (breath exert)
MID_MV30_00_m013: (noticing exert)
MID_MV30_00_m014: (pained groans)